                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#172033",
                      "fontWeight": "semibold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Columns use the selected pattern's native unit. The dashed line uses a separate axis for Cowork session intensity. Usage stages run from Non-user to Power User.",
